  "description": "Installation of a Swift Tower to provide nesting spaces for Swifts. This involves erecting a telegraph pole with nesting boxes attached to the top. The pole will be no more than 10 metres above ground level, and will sit 1.5 metres into the ground, stabilised by concrete. This would be a new development and will be installed on a small patch of grass. This will be happening at the London Wetland Centre which is a paid entry visitor attraction. ",
